{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">周嘉洛日前驚喜現身尖沙咀商場，為相機及服裝品牌擔任「一日店長」，吸引大批粉絲到場支持。他全程表現親民，笑容滿面，展現出極強的親和力與號召力，堪稱全場最具吸引力的星級店長。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"你负责帅，其余的交给柯达。_1_皇太后养的猫_来自小红书网页版.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wakjsj28IP1790755468.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"你负责帅，其余的交给柯达。_1_皇太后养的猫_来自小红书网页版.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_95c7a751709266b9-39\" style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> 活動期間，周嘉洛盡責地在收銀櫃枱前招待客人，並大方讓粉絲與傳媒拍照留念。他對着鏡頭擺出招牌的「單指戳臉頰」可愛姿勢，展現俏皮一面。為了配合店長身份，他更換上品牌標誌性的亮黃色圍裙，雙手豎起大拇指比讚，並展露燦爛陽光的笑容，為現場注入滿滿的正能量。</p><p id=\"p-rc_95c7a751709266b9-39\" style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"香港海港城｜周嘉洛一日店長_1_Fa.kwan_来自小红书网页版.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026oOU1X4GkSP1790755468.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"香港海港城｜周嘉洛一日店長_1_Fa.kwan_来自小红书网页版.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了與現場粉絲親切互動，周嘉洛亦親自擔任模特兒示範休閒穿搭。他穿著藍色品牌T恤搭配深色連帽外套，在貨架前認真視察商品，展現專注的神情。其後，他在展櫃前張開雙手，擺出熱情歡迎客人的姿勢，盡顯陽光大男孩的活潑本色。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"香港海港城｜周嘉洛一日店長_6_Fa.kwan_来自小红书网页版.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026chBMnxjMJU1790755469.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"香港海港城｜周嘉洛一日店長_6_Fa.kwan_来自小红书网页版.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"香港海港城｜周嘉洛一日店長_10_Fa.kwan_来自小红书网页版.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Df4wFSPhzj1790755469.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"香港海港城｜周嘉洛一日店長_10_Fa.kwan_来自小红书网页版.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"香港海港城｜周嘉洛一日店長_3_Fa.kwan_来自小红书网页版.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026VOticpUrTP1790755469.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"香港海港城｜周嘉洛一日店長_3_Fa.kwan_来自小红书网页版.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T08:40:09.331044+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}